{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T04:04:40Z","created_by_operation":"op_df82d93b9d78477fb22075a6516db635","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_2b778e362b789acf06c003e9b25f5e597765d6c63ab65aca0828a993832ae22f","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=specifications","setting":"langchain-ai/openwiki@e92cc11723a8 snapshot 33a575400f233391","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_3e0e33767299ef573814bc802067ec67f8e6896a1c6f2e1d5323bba37563df79"],"source_ids":["src_3bd011bc315c56aaaa558de8bd0d9c1b"],"text":"OpenWiki is a CLI that writes and maintains a wiki for a codebase or personal knowledge, generating linked Markdown intended as agent memory, with an interactive visualizer for humans.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T04:04:40Z","updated_by_operation":"op_df82d93b9d78477fb22075a6516db635"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T04:04:40Z","created_by_operation":"op_df82d93b9d78477fb22075a6516db635","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_4192d1f20a41790de62927a8bf4e23e50a578911d424b6b5c161ae53da67143e","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=design-choices","setting":"langchain-ai/openwiki@e92cc11723a8 snapshot 33a575400f233391","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_0a444b55691a3b9c8cb8897a59c23cd6927e9ba038301915d05c8e30554ba795","slc_90639fa9363ff5f6b9c1408250253f8c3aabe830bbb841b712f475e20636b52f","slc_bc0648be54b0939053f6e0b765568b7eaebbb8b446c6210a0c89b0722428c7d9"],"source_ids":["src_3bd011bc315c56aaaa558de8bd0d9c1b"],"text":"The tool offers two modes: a default 'code' wiki for the current repository written to openwiki/, and a 'personal' wiki for connected sources written to ~/.openwiki/wiki.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T04:04:40Z","updated_by_operation":"op_df82d93b9d78477fb22075a6516db635"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T04:04:40Z","created_by_operation":"op_df82d93b9d78477fb22075a6516db635","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_458eb8c35b488e7bbd5daeb0ea605e97f9f53dbdf6a981e784eea8dd052280f2","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=memory-state","setting":"langchain-ai/openwiki@e92cc11723a8 snapshot 33a575400f233391","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_97961c15a8c0cc549da1caef5dce7351e0e61da078917ed18eb7c6ed75224b62","slc_9ca2889991c9eb6d69ae4d193815bb7508f0cbc17c05677198e7110daea12412","slc_ae1efe01ff4910ec7989c7fb39e8fb7f3f0d85284f72776ea269fa94b3fed85c"],"source_ids":["src_3bd011bc315c56aaaa558de8bd0d9c1b"],"text":"Local state (credentials, personal wiki, connector data, history, skills) lives under ~/.openwiki by default, relocatable via OPENWIKI_CONFIG_DIR; the override does not move or delete the existing directory.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T04:04:40Z","updated_by_operation":"op_df82d93b9d78477fb22075a6516db635"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T04:04:40Z","created_by_operation":"op_df82d93b9d78477fb22075a6516db635","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_528cc5c643665c905dd3e157be0e367b6ab38dfc352531c99cbc5402e53ff779","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=workflows","setting":"langchain-ai/openwiki@e92cc11723a8 snapshot 33a575400f233391","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_8c6d6fc3db15a08ae223902e158c3a653ff101dfb38ba2992d1a0db7b6786e9b"],"source_ids":["src_3bd011bc315c56aaaa558de8bd0d9c1b"],"text":"Repository development practice: contributors adding another coding-agent integration are directed to follow the 'Adding a coding-agent integration' section of CONTRIBUTING.md.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T04:04:40Z","updated_by_operation":"op_df82d93b9d78477fb22075a6516db635"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T04:04:40Z","created_by_operation":"op_df82d93b9d78477fb22075a6516db635","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_9433e3f7348319bb6dce728194df4e95348727219e5bf8067ffa98bf1cdf21cc","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=components","setting":"langchain-ai/openwiki@e92cc11723a8 snapshot 33a575400f233391","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_79996b57427e1868fc1811baf9507fa18236d252915ced039f19374687b3bdbc","slc_99e75ac54bfe3a4d476ac5dcc934446762135e8c0880434857ce389d456d6c56","slc_c582810fe5a996158d3b7c7ed42fc8af015732d9809d3d90c8bcdd4b2ebfdcfd"],"source_ids":["src_3bd011bc315c56aaaa558de8bd0d9c1b"],"text":"Grounded Claims track material propositions in code wikis back to versioned repository evidence (e.g. repo:// paths with line ranges), stored as sidecars under openwiki/.claims/ rather than in the Markdown.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T04:04:40Z","updated_by_operation":"op_df82d93b9d78477fb22075a6516db635"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T04:04:40Z","created_by_operation":"op_df82d93b9d78477fb22075a6516db635","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_a27e5781554a893e3a776cb10305633de0a19df1691c8c5eebb56741792b23e2","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=orchestration","setting":"langchain-ai/openwiki@e92cc11723a8 snapshot 33a575400f233391","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_60140e2c27724ef0081900f09f50ec63730d3f2de8a2ca0f689bdd884892a2e0","slc_dadbcc02e6a1b24153f724238d141b38be95a5fc6219d5cee86bf32e0e1f6ffc"],"source_ids":["src_3bd011bc315c56aaaa558de8bd0d9c1b"],"text":"Repository generation follows a resumable page-job lifecycle (begin, submit_plan, next_page, submit_page, finish) with a durable ordered queue checkpointed in openwiki/.run.json; each page becomes durable before advancing.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T04:04:40Z","updated_by_operation":"op_df82d93b9d78477fb22075a6516db635"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T04:04:40Z","created_by_operation":"op_df82d93b9d78477fb22075a6516db635","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_c50df9377a7b1a93d01457c261ada7523e340feb6608910be5495eeb8bc5e78f","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=limitations","setting":"langchain-ai/openwiki@e92cc11723a8 snapshot 33a575400f233391","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_6fb8c24a612e0bf4cb36ccd3c9b8b0af84d263d74aeca048764f1a6381f315eb","slc_d86afab4823145b157e78e23235216573f18ec49569602355a2e3f8a4197355d","slc_dab82278aa4c37aec3930bd34e6c14e4d2635dbe98072b4dc9850c33c4c1f61c"],"source_ids":["src_3bd011bc315c56aaaa558de8bd0d9c1b"],"text":"Per the README, host-driven coding-agent runs support only repository code wikis (not personal brains), use only repository source and tests (no connector context including LangSmith), and Grounded Claims apply only to repository evidence.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T04:04:40Z","updated_by_operation":"op_df82d93b9d78477fb22075a6516db635"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T04:04:40Z","created_by_operation":"op_df82d93b9d78477fb22075a6516db635","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_c64f28cea96f70a75e0a55daecc1e11a85f6bdf279b23ab30c563ec0e12c7450","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=design-choices","setting":"langchain-ai/openwiki@e92cc11723a8 snapshot 33a575400f233391","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_eb5d6f1345ce5b430a24afb96eb7e75cd4af213ecbeb6ebc10ed19ba162ec20c","slc_f82b5756eb78e2580ea59ae7c52a8cf73378e0f14651ac4d586a9ebd7f001a3b"],"source_ids":["src_3bd011bc315c56aaaa558de8bd0d9c1b"],"text":"Output follows Open Knowledge Format (OKF) v0.2 with YAML front matter, generated/verified provenance stamps, validated optional trust and lifecycle fields, and reserved index.md and log.md documents.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T04:04:40Z","updated_by_operation":"op_df82d93b9d78477fb22075a6516db635"}
